Third-party files: BREEDS class hierarchy

class_hierarchy.txt, dataset_class_info.json and node_names.txt in this folder
are unmodified copies of imagenet_class_hierarchy/modified/ from
MadryLab/BREEDS-Benchmarks (https://github.com/MadryLab/BREEDS-Benchmarks),
accompanying Santurkar, Tsipras and Madry, "BREEDS: Benchmarks for
Subpopulation Shift", ICLR 2021. The upstream repository states no license.
They are redistributed here with attribution, only so that the ImageNet
BREEDS-46 partition can be rebuilt offline (data/imagenet.py); they are not
covered by this repository's MIT license, and all rights remain with their
authors.
